/-!
# Parabolics for the three-by-three digon

The two coordinate stabilizers in S₃ × S₃ multiply to the whole group and
have index three, giving the subgroup model for the digon residue in
Aschbacher–Smith I.5.3. The coordinate homomorphisms describe its independent
permutation actions. These stabilizers exhaust the maximal Sylow overgroups,
and their actual coset geometry is the complete three-by-three digon. Their
two-cores have order two, their core quotients are S₃, and the ambient
two-core is trivial. The joint action on the two coset spaces is faithful;
each individual action has the opposite full S₃ factor as its kernel.
-/
